{
  "$comment": "DDD bridge for Microsoft Fluent 2 (web). Tiers follow elements/d-d-d/design-system/bridge/contract.json. Fluent publishes its tokens only as JavaScript (@fluentui/tokens, the token package @fluentui/react-components 9 depends on), so the source is read with the js-literals format: palettes and token objects are read for literal values and palette references, nothing is evaluated. Token names keep Fluent's own CSS names (--colorNeutralBackground1, as @fluentui/web-components writes them); palettes are written under --fluent-. Named DDD colors point at fixed Fluent shared colors and the web brand ramp by role. Kept as DDD on purpose: light and black font weights (Fluent has regular, medium, semibold and bold), state opacities (Fluent uses hover and pressed colors), border widths, and heading/body sizes (Fluent body1 is 14px, below the 16px floor). Fluent's spacing steps (2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32px) sit close to DDD's 4px grid, so the theme chrome uses DDD spacing tokens.",
  "system": "fluent",
  "title": "Fluent 2",
  "prefix": "Fluent",
  "homepage": "https://fluent2.microsoft.design",
  "sources": [
    {
      "package": "@fluentui/tokens",
      "version": "1.0.0-alpha.24",
      "license": "MIT",
      "copyright": "Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation",
      "homepage": "https://fluent2.microsoft.design",
      "repository": "https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui",
      "format": "js-literals",
      "palettePrefix": "--fluent-",
      "prefix": "--",
      "palettes": [
        "lib-commonjs/global/colors.cjs",
        "lib-commonjs/global/brandColors.cjs"
      ],
      "refs": {
        "brand": "brandWeb"
      },
      "files": {
        "light": [
          "lib-commonjs/global/borderRadius.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/fonts.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/durations.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/curves.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/strokeWidths.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/alias/lightColor.cjs"
        ],
        "dark": [
          "lib-commonjs/global/borderRadius.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/fonts.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/durations.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/curves.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/global/strokeWidths.cjs",
          "lib-commonjs/alias/darkColor.cjs"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
